        Task 024 (FR-07/NFR-06 fidelity seam test) is the reference `WebApplicationFactory` harness — Load a formatted fixture, edit, Save through the real route, assert persisted OOXML. Mirror its structure for the imported-marks-survival assertion.
      </pattern>
